WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.020 --> 01:47.820
=Episode 20=

01:48.226 --> 01:49.960
(Wedding)
Did everyone enjoy the food?

01:49.960 --> 01:51.559
Yeah, they did.

01:52.160 --> 01:52.919
Mr. Li,

01:52.919 --> 01:54.679
your cooking is pretty good.

01:55.559 --> 01:57.119
Especially that stir-fried pork,

01:57.279 --> 01:59.160
even better
than the state-run restaurant.

02:00.919 --> 02:02.319
Here's your payment.

02:02.479 --> 02:03.520
Alright.

02:03.679 --> 02:05.160
Call us again if there's work.

02:05.160 --> 02:06.039
No problem.

02:07.248 --> 02:08.320
I won't see you off then.

02:08.320 --> 02:08.920
Alright.

02:08.920 --> 02:10.248
- Don't let us keep you.
- Alright.

02:12.760 --> 02:13.960
Come on, Mr. Fei.

02:17.960 --> 02:18.950
That's too much, Mr. Li.

02:19.399 --> 02:20.200
Not at all.

02:20.559 --> 02:21.679
Didn't you hear that lady

02:21.679 --> 02:23.080
praising your stir-fried pork?

02:23.119 --> 02:24.150
You helped me out big time.

02:25.480 --> 02:26.559
Thank you, Mr. Li.

02:28.010 --> 02:30.540
There'll be plenty of chances
for us to make money in the future.

02:30.559 --> 02:31.360
Old rule.

02:32.404 --> 02:33.480
Get rid of the smell first.

02:59.040 --> 02:59.800
Fei Ni,

03:01.119 --> 03:03.080
is this teacher me?

03:06.360 --> 03:07.559
You've got some nerve.

03:07.559 --> 03:10.480
I look like this, and you still call me

03:10.640 --> 03:12.159
the scenery of Jiangcheng.

03:18.719 --> 03:20.719
Hello, everyone. My name is Fei Ni.

03:21.119 --> 03:23.119
This is my teacher.

03:23.559 --> 03:25.399
She's the best teacher.

03:25.559 --> 03:28.240
The most beautiful scenery
in Jiangcheng.

03:36.080 --> 03:37.719
I wouldn't dare say
I'm the best teacher.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.719
But the best student

03:42.040 --> 03:44.040
was taught by me!

03:45.719 --> 03:46.520
Good!

04:06.640 --> 04:07.640
(That's it.)

04:07.737 --> 04:08.870
(That's the style we want.)

04:09.159 --> 04:11.279
Keep drawing in this direction.

04:11.679 --> 04:12.839
Pick up the pace.

04:13.439 --> 04:13.839
Alright.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.200
Keep it up.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.493
You've got a bright future.

04:31.719 --> 04:32.839
Feeling down?

04:36.560 --> 04:37.159
No.

04:37.560 --> 04:38.159
No?

04:38.839 --> 04:39.440
No.

04:42.839 --> 04:44.080
Did you read the newspaper?

04:44.719 --> 04:47.159
I did. Writer Fei Ni.

04:47.919 --> 04:48.719
Congratulations.

04:49.320 --> 04:51.560
It's thanks to your encouragement
these days.

04:52.560 --> 04:53.919
I have a gift for you.

04:54.719 --> 04:55.239
A gift?

04:55.640 --> 04:56.039
Yes.

04:59.270 --> 04:59.915
Turn around.

05:01.039 --> 05:02.000
Keep closing your eyes.

05:02.120 --> 05:02.479
Okay.

05:04.799 --> 05:05.279
Open them.

05:16.479 --> 05:17.560
Every Chinese New Year,

05:17.839 --> 05:19.719
my dad would make me
a carousel lantern.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.719
It may be simple,

05:22.919 --> 05:24.560
but I spent all day on it.

05:25.279 --> 05:26.080
What do you think?

05:34.919 --> 05:35.839
Why is my drawing...

05:37.719 --> 05:38.560
I...

05:39.640 --> 05:42.320
I found it in the trash can
at the newspaper office.

05:43.359 --> 05:46.880
How could such a good drawing
be thrown away?

05:51.248 --> 05:53.270
Maybe you're the only one
who thinks I draw well.

05:53.560 --> 05:54.479
What do you think?

05:56.560 --> 05:57.350
Is this one better,

05:57.919 --> 05:59.320
or the ones in the illustrated book?

06:02.479 --> 06:03.279
This is better.

06:27.560 --> 06:28.680
I want to watch a movie.

06:41.239 --> 06:42.880
During the Chinese Civil War,

06:43.719 --> 06:45.239
on the grasslands of Inner Mongolia,

06:45.960 --> 06:47.960
there was a special unit
of the People's Army,

06:50.039 --> 06:51.320
a cavalry troop.

06:53.248 --> 06:55.000
The main character, Wang,
was only fourteen

06:55.000 --> 06:56.450
when he was skilled
in riding and shooting.

06:56.460 --> 06:58.270
He was exceptionally admitted
into the cavalry.

07:00.680 --> 07:03.359
Back then, he was barely taller
than his rifle.

07:03.390 --> 07:06.180
Every time he mounted his horse,
his comrades had to give him a boost.

07:06.239 --> 07:08.159
But Wang was an excellent rider

07:08.479 --> 07:09.640
and a precise marksman.

07:14.782 --> 07:15.960
He became the youngest soldier

07:16.479 --> 07:17.919
in his company.

07:18.039 --> 07:19.680
Good!

07:40.919 --> 07:41.760
Does it hurt?

07:42.560 --> 07:43.359
No.

07:44.560 --> 07:46.039
I just feel

07:47.039 --> 07:48.640
the thing I made is kind of ugly.

07:49.440 --> 07:50.000
Ugly?

07:50.000 --> 07:50.520
Yes.

07:50.760 --> 07:51.200
Not at all.

07:51.626 --> 07:53.520
I made one for my grandma
when I was little.

07:53.520 --> 07:54.671
That one was truly ugly.

08:01.760 --> 08:02.560
Fang Muyang,

08:03.880 --> 08:08.159
I know you're used to
being on your own.

08:08.520 --> 08:11.719
So whenever something happens,
you carry it yourself.

08:11.839 --> 08:14.359
When you're unhappy,
you keep it inside.

08:15.039 --> 08:16.839
But you told me before,

08:16.839 --> 08:17.880
do you remember?

08:18.039 --> 08:20.640
You said the greatest meaning
of two people being together is...

08:22.560 --> 08:23.719
To help each other.

08:24.839 --> 08:25.799
And comfort each other.

08:28.719 --> 08:30.839
You're not alone anymore.

08:30.960 --> 08:33.040
Whether you're happy

08:33.040 --> 08:34.719
or unhappy,

08:34.719 --> 08:36.359
you can tell me.

08:36.920 --> 08:39.080
I might not be able to help much,

08:39.239 --> 08:42.320
but I'm a very good listener.

08:43.519 --> 08:44.320
Also,

08:46.560 --> 08:48.239
I'll always stand by your side.

08:50.160 --> 08:52.879
My shoulders aren't as broad as yours,

08:53.160 --> 08:54.920
but they're reliable.

08:54.920 --> 08:55.719
Try it.

08:55.719 --> 08:56.519
Go on.

08:56.519 --> 08:56.960
Let me try.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.680
Come on.

09:05.280 --> 09:06.119
How is it?

09:21.440 --> 09:25.200
You ran off to do side jobs
during work hours

09:25.440 --> 09:27.040
and even took sick leave.

09:29.400 --> 09:31.200
Do you know what that is?

09:31.599 --> 09:33.839
That's unauthorized absence

09:34.320 --> 09:35.839
and falsifying reports!

09:37.599 --> 09:39.599
You're brazen!

09:40.639 --> 09:43.080
Speak. Whose idea was it?

09:47.440 --> 09:48.400
No one's answering me?

09:49.200 --> 09:49.680
Fine.

09:50.119 --> 09:52.440
Both of you will be dismissed.

09:54.119 --> 09:55.920
Ms. Xu, please don't fire me.

09:55.920 --> 09:57.320
I'm the only one in my family

09:57.320 --> 09:58.359
with a job and a salary.

09:58.359 --> 09:59.359
If you fire me,

09:59.359 --> 10:00.759
my whole family will starve.

10:00.759 --> 10:01.719
Now you're scared?

10:02.119 --> 10:03.359
Why weren't you scared

10:03.359 --> 10:04.800
when you broke factory rules?

10:04.839 --> 10:06.310
Aren't you good at making extra money?

10:06.320 --> 10:07.200
Go make it.

10:07.719 --> 10:09.999
The factory has no place for you.

10:10.040 --> 10:10.960
I promise

10:10.960 --> 10:12.519
I'll never earn extra money again.

10:13.639 --> 10:15.119
I'm begging you, please.

10:15.119 --> 10:15.599
I...

10:15.960 --> 10:18.080
I've worked in the canteen
for so many years.

10:18.080 --> 10:19.359
I'm one of the old staff.

10:19.359 --> 10:21.680
Please don't fire me.

10:22.040 --> 10:22.639
Ms. Xu.

10:24.400 --> 10:26.137
I encouraged Mr. Li to take side jobs.

10:26.839 --> 10:27.519
Fire me.

10:27.999 --> 10:28.759
Let him stay.

10:35.719 --> 10:38.119
Fei Ting, think carefully.

10:38.160 --> 10:40.582
You haven't even been
in the Publicity Department for a year.

10:40.639 --> 10:41.639
If you're fired,

10:41.830 --> 10:43.582
where will you find
such a good job again?

10:44.400 --> 10:44.960
Chief Wang,

10:45.999 --> 10:47.560
whether I'm cut out for publicity work,

10:47.560 --> 10:49.160
you've known the answer
for a long time.

10:49.400 --> 10:50.960
You just didn't want to say it.

10:51.839 --> 10:53.239
During my time there,

10:53.719 --> 10:54.920
I caused you plenty of trouble.

10:55.759 --> 10:56.359
Sorry.

10:58.715 --> 11:00.382
Since I'm not suited for it,

11:00.448 --> 11:02.830
I shouldn't sit in a toilet stall
without doing my business.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.448
Or I wouldn't feel right about it.

11:05.280 --> 11:06.839
Watch your attitude.

11:06.839 --> 11:07.639
Speak properly.

11:07.639 --> 11:08.820
What's with the "toilet stall"?

11:08.830 --> 11:10.610
Is the Publicity Department
a toilet to you?

11:11.999 --> 11:12.440
Look.

11:13.280 --> 11:15.160
This is about my level.

11:15.639 --> 11:16.119
Yes,

11:16.960 --> 11:18.400
I really don't have any great skills,

11:18.537 --> 11:19.604
but I still have my pride.

11:19.737 --> 11:21.493
The Publicity Department
is a good position,

11:21.510 --> 11:23.226
but I honestly
don't feel at ease doing it.

11:25.560 --> 11:25.999
Ms. Xu,

11:26.800 --> 11:28.239
the canteen can't do without Mr. Li.

11:28.639 --> 11:31.400
But whether the Publicity Department
has me or not, it's the same.

11:31.737 --> 11:33.440
This matter must be dealt with
seriously.

11:33.639 --> 11:34.440
Then deal with me.

11:34.839 --> 11:35.839
Keep Mr. Li.

11:37.440 --> 11:38.040
Please.

11:44.200 --> 11:44.960
Li Xuebing.

11:46.999 --> 11:47.999
One official demerit.

11:48.515 --> 11:51.382
No eligibility for any "Outstanding
Workers" evaluations within a year.

11:51.599 --> 11:53.200
Alright.

11:54.400 --> 11:55.040
Fei Ting.

11:57.839 --> 11:58.400
Dismissed.

12:10.226 --> 12:10.920
Fei Ni.

12:12.999 --> 12:14.920
Fei Ting's been fired.

12:15.239 --> 12:15.759
What?

12:16.280 --> 12:17.599
I just ran into Chief Wang.

12:17.839 --> 12:19.440
She asked me to tell you.

12:19.510 --> 12:21.493
I've helped you ask for leave.
Hurry and go on.

12:36.359 --> 12:36.839
Ting.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.800
I was told you were fired.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.519
Did they wrong you?

12:42.626 --> 12:45.182
You stopped doing side jobs
with Mr. Li a long time ago.

12:46.239 --> 12:47.800
Come on. Let's go reason with them.

12:51.719 --> 12:53.040
You...

12:57.680 --> 12:58.560
I'm sorry, Ni.

13:00.560 --> 13:01.648
I...

13:02.599 --> 13:03.599
I'll be honest with you.

13:04.590 --> 13:05.982
In the Publicity Department,

13:06.519 --> 13:09.320
I always felt like I didn't belong.

13:10.280 --> 13:11.479
I can't write articles.

13:11.879 --> 13:13.639
I don't understand publicity materials.

13:13.719 --> 13:15.680
I even mess up organizing events.

13:16.280 --> 13:17.080
Ni,

13:17.440 --> 13:18.519
these hands of mine

13:18.800 --> 13:19.989
can handle a hoe, a sickle,

13:19.990 --> 13:21.137
a wok spatula, or a big ladle.

13:21.140 --> 13:21.680
No problem.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.440
But not a pen.

13:24.080 --> 13:26.200
Every day I watched everyone
running around busy,

13:27.048 --> 13:28.982
and I couldn't do anything right.

13:34.519 --> 13:36.999
That day, Fang Muyang
said something to me.

13:37.400 --> 13:38.040
He said

13:38.839 --> 13:40.960
everyone has their strengths
and weaknesses.

13:41.680 --> 13:43.239
A person should be like a screw,

13:43.400 --> 13:44.560
put in the right place.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.080
I've been sneaking out

13:46.080 --> 13:47.680
to cook with Mr. Li lately.

13:47.800 --> 13:48.359
I admit,

13:48.680 --> 13:50.759
at first, I just wanted
to earn some extra money.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.359
But later I realized

13:53.800 --> 13:56.680
I'm actually good at it.

13:57.248 --> 13:59.071
The more I did it,
the more energized I felt.

13:59.200 --> 14:01.359
When I heard people praise my cooking,

14:02.160 --> 14:02.999
I was so happy.

14:03.599 --> 14:06.800
I felt capable.

14:08.560 --> 14:09.800
Do you understand, Ni?

14:13.280 --> 14:13.920
I do.

14:16.200 --> 14:17.879
Why didn't you tell me

14:18.879 --> 14:20.719
what you were going through?

14:25.119 --> 14:26.960
I'm a man. I have my pride.

14:29.560 --> 14:29.999
Besides,

14:30.800 --> 14:31.960
I didn't want you to worry.

14:33.800 --> 14:35.359
Now that it's blown up like this,

14:36.479 --> 14:37.519
what are you going to do?

14:38.680 --> 14:39.599
Honestly,

14:40.760 --> 14:41.960
I haven't figured it out yet.

14:42.479 --> 14:43.239
But

14:43.599 --> 14:45.960
I'm a grown man. I can work.

14:46.320 --> 14:47.320
I won't starve.

14:49.271 --> 14:51.540
And I won't let Mom and Dad
or Lin Wei go hungry either.

14:52.359 --> 14:53.200
I have faith in you.

14:55.359 --> 14:57.519
But don't tell Lin Mei yet.

14:57.848 --> 14:59.960
Her parents just started
treating me a little better.

15:00.060 --> 15:02.093
I don't want to make things hard for her
right now.

15:02.280 --> 15:02.879
Alright.

15:04.759 --> 15:06.280
But promise me.

15:06.400 --> 15:07.800
If you ever run into trouble again,

15:08.093 --> 15:09.200
you won't hide it from me.

15:10.599 --> 15:11.200
Okay.

15:14.759 --> 15:15.349
Give it a try.

15:15.350 --> 15:16.826
Like I taught you when we were kids.

15:25.320 --> 15:26.359
Throw it flatter.

15:53.879 --> 15:54.800
You scared me.

15:54.800 --> 15:55.999
Lock the door.

15:57.582 --> 15:58.893
You're reading again?

15:59.400 --> 16:00.519
You've read this many times.

16:00.960 --> 16:02.719
Here. Let me show you something.

16:02.719 --> 16:04.980
(Iron Cavalry Boy)

16:05.400 --> 16:07.160
The comic strip has been published?

16:07.320 --> 16:07.879
Yes.

16:16.119 --> 16:17.999
How come your name is not on it?

16:18.137 --> 16:19.560
I helped Mr. Yuan with the drawings.

16:19.650 --> 16:20.980
Of course it goes under his name.

16:20.999 --> 16:23.359
You drew most of it.

16:24.119 --> 16:25.359
I don't care about that.

16:26.320 --> 16:27.200
What I care about...

16:31.359 --> 16:31.960
is this.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.320
They gave you the payment.

16:36.599 --> 16:37.400
Take it.

16:47.200 --> 16:47.879
Look at you.

16:48.026 --> 16:49.871
Your eyes light up
the second you see money.

16:50.119 --> 16:50.999
Of course.

16:50.999 --> 16:52.560
Who doesn't like money?

16:52.920 --> 16:56.160
We can buy you a new
short-sleeved shirt

16:57.280 --> 16:59.359
and a pair of rubber shoes.

16:59.800 --> 17:00.960
What about you?

17:01.200 --> 17:03.519
I don't need it. I don't need anything.

17:04.279 --> 17:06.759
Up to you. You manage
all the money anyway.

17:06.920 --> 17:07.960
Buy whatever you like.

17:12.559 --> 17:13.440
Keep this.

17:14.559 --> 17:15.680
Pocket money.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.540
Not afraid I'll spend it recklessly?

17:17.559 --> 17:19.400
I'll trust you for now.

17:19.680 --> 17:21.400
Don't disappoint me.

17:22.559 --> 17:24.319
Yes, Comrade Fei Ni.

17:24.448 --> 17:25.871
Don't do this. It's like my brother.

17:27.880 --> 17:30.160
"I don't have pocket money now."

17:30.360 --> 17:31.640
You look just like him.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.479
Look. I'll turn the pages for you.

17:38.079 --> 17:40.279
The scene I performed for you
that day was this one.

18:01.070 --> 18:02.293
Let me say a couple of lines.

18:02.479 --> 18:04.079
Today is a happy day.

18:04.799 --> 18:06.759
Fang's comic strip

18:06.759 --> 18:07.880
has finally been published.

18:07.880 --> 18:08.999
Come on, let's celebrate.

18:09.759 --> 18:10.600
Thanks, Dad.

18:14.799 --> 18:18.999
But why didn't you put
your own name on it?

18:19.200 --> 18:20.440
I can't tell people

18:20.440 --> 18:22.120
it was you

18:22.519 --> 18:23.920
who drew it.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.319
Well, that's alright.

18:26.719 --> 18:28.920
At least now you're earning
your own living

18:29.200 --> 18:30.400
and supporting the family.

18:30.400 --> 18:31.600
That makes you a real man.

18:31.600 --> 18:32.239
Come.

18:33.200 --> 18:33.840
Thank you, Dad.

18:34.680 --> 18:37.559
Fang, if your drawings do well,

18:37.559 --> 18:38.309
is there a chance

18:38.310 --> 18:40.026
they'll give you a permanent position?

18:40.559 --> 18:41.279
Mom,

18:41.400 --> 18:43.120
things are fine as they are.

18:43.680 --> 18:45.479
I didn't say they weren't.

18:45.479 --> 18:46.920
It's just that it's not stable.

18:46.960 --> 18:49.360
Look at your brother.
His job in Publicity doesn't pay much,

18:49.426 --> 18:50.510
but it's a formal position.

18:50.519 --> 18:52.719
He brings his wages home every month.

18:52.960 --> 18:53.999
You'd feel more at ease,

18:54.239 --> 18:54.600
right?

18:54.600 --> 18:55.515
The dishes are here.

18:56.999 --> 18:58.960
Mom, Dad, you eat first.

18:58.960 --> 19:00.999
I'll wait for Lin Mei.

19:01.360 --> 19:03.400
Fang, have a drink with Dad.

19:04.319 --> 19:05.960
Mom, I'm going to oil my bike chain.

19:06.100 --> 19:07.310
At least eat something first.

19:07.319 --> 19:08.200
Mom.

19:08.360 --> 19:09.279
Let him go.

19:12.200 --> 19:13.360
About work,

19:13.360 --> 19:14.559
I'm different from Ting.

19:15.519 --> 19:18.759
I'm not suited for something too stable.

19:20.600 --> 19:22.400
Right. Everyone has their own ambitions.

19:22.999 --> 19:23.479
Here.

19:23.479 --> 19:25.799
To those with ambition. May you succeed.

19:27.239 --> 19:29.160
Slow down. Easy.

19:36.600 --> 19:37.360
Ting.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.200
What brings you here?

19:39.960 --> 19:42.279
Not bad.
You've polished the bike so well.

19:42.680 --> 19:44.039
You've kept it in great shape.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.400
My dad

19:45.799 --> 19:46.920
bought this bike.

19:47.026 --> 19:47.990
Later, he gave it to me.

19:48.293 --> 19:50.671
When I was sent down to the countryside,
I passed it to Ni.

19:51.471 --> 19:52.750
It's been almost ten years now.

19:53.999 --> 19:55.400
How have you been lately?

19:57.279 --> 19:58.079
Pretty good.

19:59.360 --> 20:00.920
Mr. Li has been decent to me.

20:01.719 --> 20:03.479
The factory's been strict lately,

20:03.600 --> 20:05.600
so he's passed some of his work
over to me.

20:06.120 --> 20:08.880
I can scrape together
a bit of income each month.

20:09.880 --> 20:11.039
You look better

20:11.319 --> 20:12.840
than when you were at the factory.

20:13.479 --> 20:14.079
Really?

20:15.559 --> 20:16.759
When I'm not cooking,

20:16.759 --> 20:18.200
I roast sweet potatoes.

20:18.537 --> 20:19.710
It helps make ends meet.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.360
You'd better be careful.

20:23.920 --> 20:24.999
Cooking is one thing.

20:25.319 --> 20:27.799
Sneaking around selling sweet potatoes
is profiteering.

20:28.360 --> 20:29.680
Don't get caught.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.479
Relax. I'm careful.

20:34.600 --> 20:36.319
So, when are you going to tell Mei?

20:43.680 --> 20:45.999
I don't even know how to start,
to be honest.

20:47.493 --> 20:49.226
I'll keep it from her as long as I can.

20:55.360 --> 20:56.230
What are you doing?

20:57.493 --> 20:58.560
I can't take this.

21:00.937 --> 21:02.470
If you don't want her to find out,

21:02.510 --> 21:04.360
you'd better turn in every cent
of your salary

21:04.400 --> 21:05.840
for the next few months, right?

21:07.880 --> 21:09.319
Have you saved enough for this month?

21:13.479 --> 21:14.799
Don't turn me down.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.999
We're always comrades on the same side.

21:21.279 --> 21:21.799
Alright.

21:22.479 --> 21:23.319
I won't refuse then.

21:23.880 --> 21:24.799
I'll pay you back.

21:30.026 --> 21:31.460
Finish up and come upstairs to eat.

21:31.519 --> 21:31.880
Okay.

21:46.960 --> 21:47.680
Wu.

21:48.559 --> 21:51.319
Our project team made
a major breakthrough this time.

21:51.759 --> 21:54.079
Also, we were commended by the Ministry.

21:54.600 --> 21:57.479
Your team deserves the highest credit.

21:57.680 --> 22:00.079
Come on, say a few words.

22:00.680 --> 22:01.680
Zhou,

22:01.680 --> 22:02.880
you flatter me.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.880
The progress we made

22:05.120 --> 22:07.519
belongs to every single member,

22:07.920 --> 22:09.160
especially

22:09.160 --> 22:10.719
Fang Mujing's group.

22:11.079 --> 22:11.600
Fang,

22:11.799 --> 22:13.960
you didn't let
Professor Zhou and me down.

22:14.840 --> 22:16.999
Thank you for giving me
this opportunity.

22:16.999 --> 22:18.360
I'll work harder.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.600
Let me toast you.

22:23.440 --> 22:25.960
I've never seen you drink before.
Don't push yourself.

22:25.999 --> 22:28.479
Not at all. Today's a celebration.

22:28.680 --> 22:29.360
I want to drink.

22:29.519 --> 22:30.120
Good.

22:30.120 --> 22:31.200
Right, drink a few more.

22:31.559 --> 22:32.559
- Come.
- Come.

22:42.210 --> 22:43.600
Fang can hold her liquor quite well.

22:43.600 --> 22:44.079
Right?

22:45.048 --> 22:45.860
Come. Eat the dishes.

22:45.920 --> 22:46.360
Sure.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.519
I'd also like to toast all my coworkers.

22:49.137 --> 22:50.671
In the past, I wasn't qualified

22:50.715 --> 22:52.871
to participate in any national-level
research project.

22:53.160 --> 22:54.559
But now, not only did I take part,

22:54.920 --> 22:56.559
but I also made my own contribution.

22:57.360 --> 22:59.600
Thank you for your
tolerance and support.

23:00.120 --> 23:01.360
Here's to everyone.

23:01.360 --> 23:01.840
Come.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.719
Everyone here is
a good comrade of socialism.

23:14.120 --> 23:14.915
Be that as it may,

23:14.960 --> 23:17.039
we mustn't rest on our laurels.

23:17.960 --> 23:18.960
The chief said

23:18.960 --> 23:21.519
they expect even greater
achievements from us.

23:23.719 --> 23:25.519
Professor Zhou is treating today.

23:25.519 --> 23:27.069
Let's all toast him.

23:27.070 --> 23:28.448
- Thank you, everyone.
- Come.

23:33.840 --> 23:34.200
Alright.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.440
Don't just drink.

23:35.440 --> 23:36.319
Eat the dishes.

23:48.400 --> 23:49.400
Spit it out.

23:49.440 --> 23:50.680
It's fine once you throw up.

23:51.937 --> 23:53.210
There were many leaders just now.

23:53.271 --> 23:54.120
I couldn't stop you.

23:54.120 --> 23:55.079
You can't drink.

23:55.079 --> 23:56.079
Why drink so much?

23:56.582 --> 23:57.510
Throw it up again.

23:58.600 --> 23:59.519
You don't understand.

24:01.319 --> 24:02.239
I've waited eight years

24:03.079 --> 24:04.640
for this one toast.

24:06.519 --> 24:07.920
Eight years of hard work

24:08.479 --> 24:09.600
just to have my name

24:09.600 --> 24:11.440
listed alongside theirs.

24:14.279 --> 24:15.279
Every glass I drank

24:15.920 --> 24:17.640
was earned

24:17.640 --> 24:18.871
with countless efforts.

24:19.640 --> 24:21.279
I deserve to drink more.

24:21.799 --> 24:23.120
Why should I drink less?

24:26.400 --> 24:27.200
Alright, alright.

24:28.319 --> 24:28.880
Jing,

24:29.200 --> 24:30.279
I understand

24:30.799 --> 24:31.799
what you went through.

24:32.840 --> 24:33.799
You worked so hard

24:33.799 --> 24:35.120
to get into this project team.

24:36.200 --> 24:37.319
You even settled

24:37.319 --> 24:38.999
for marrying someone you don't love.

24:40.319 --> 24:40.920
I admit it.

24:42.120 --> 24:43.319
It was my fault.

24:43.840 --> 24:44.799
I was cowardly.

24:45.279 --> 24:46.999
But things are different now.

24:47.440 --> 24:48.920
You've proven yourself.

24:48.920 --> 24:50.120
Even without him

24:50.279 --> 24:51.440
or his family background,

24:51.440 --> 24:53.400
you could still stay on the team.

24:54.279 --> 24:55.079
So Jing,

24:55.404 --> 24:56.920
I hope you can think it through...

24:56.920 --> 24:58.440
How do you know I don't love him?

24:59.470 --> 25:01.804
And what makes you think
I still love you?

25:03.999 --> 25:05.999
Liu Wei, you're full of yourself.

25:07.120 --> 25:09.709
Don't think it was you
who abandoned me back then.

25:09.710 --> 25:11.893
That was my choice, too.

25:12.279 --> 25:12.840
So

25:13.319 --> 25:15.519
know your place.

25:16.137 --> 25:18.226
There can never be anything between us

25:18.319 --> 25:20.719
beyond colleagues.

25:25.479 --> 25:26.039
By the way,

25:27.039 --> 25:29.600
since you know I have a husband,

25:31.360 --> 25:32.440
you should also understand

25:32.440 --> 25:33.920
that what you said just now

25:34.479 --> 25:36.519
is an attempt to undermine our marriage.

25:36.799 --> 25:38.479
If I report this to the organization,

25:39.239 --> 25:40.719
the one who leaves this time

25:41.360 --> 25:42.239
won't be me.

25:45.200 --> 25:45.640
Jing.

25:45.920 --> 25:46.999
Don't follow me.

26:19.920 --> 26:20.920
You're here.

26:53.799 --> 26:54.799
Wipe your mouth.

27:33.759 --> 27:35.279
I dreamed about you again.

27:37.799 --> 27:40.279
I keep dreaming about you lately.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.559
Why don't you speak?

27:51.719 --> 27:54.400
You never speak in my dreams.

27:54.920 --> 27:57.120
It's always me talking.

28:01.360 --> 28:03.719
Are you also this quiet with Yan?

28:06.319 --> 28:07.400
What do you want me to say?

28:10.519 --> 28:11.640
Do you love me?

28:23.960 --> 28:24.519
I love you.

28:29.200 --> 28:30.759
Liar.

28:31.799 --> 28:34.920
You can't even tell
whether I'm Yan or me.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.279
I can.

28:40.360 --> 28:43.279
Actually, I've always felt
you two are different.

28:45.920 --> 28:46.759
Very different.

28:54.880 --> 28:55.960
Really?

28:58.519 --> 28:59.960
How are we different?

29:09.960 --> 29:11.999
It's okay if you lie.

29:13.719 --> 29:15.559
I should thank you, Qu Hua.

29:17.880 --> 29:19.400
If it weren't for you,

29:20.160 --> 29:21.440
my name wouldn't have appeared

29:21.440 --> 29:24.079
in the commendation notice.

29:26.360 --> 29:27.559
Thank you.

29:29.519 --> 29:30.799
Am I

29:31.759 --> 29:33.079
just a label

29:33.640 --> 29:35.120
from a military family?

29:40.880 --> 29:41.999
You're so nice.

29:44.279 --> 29:45.880
You're wonderful as a person,

29:47.600 --> 29:49.319
more than your background.

29:59.799 --> 30:03.160
Why is my head suddenly full of you?

30:05.519 --> 30:07.799
Why?

30:10.079 --> 30:10.880
Mine, too.

30:14.093 --> 30:15.404
You're everywhere in my head.

31:04.936 --> 31:07.759
Ding Yang, you're back from your trip?

31:11.319 --> 31:11.999
You're awake.

31:19.799 --> 31:20.999
When did you get here?

31:22.160 --> 31:23.360
You drank quite a lot.

31:24.160 --> 31:26.079
You don't remember
what happened yesterday?

31:36.600 --> 31:37.559
You're here.

31:40.160 --> 31:41.360
It wasn't a dream.

31:41.799 --> 31:43.039
Drink less next time.

31:43.600 --> 31:45.279
Don't give others an opportunity.

31:47.880 --> 31:48.799
What do you mean?

31:54.600 --> 31:55.680
You heard everything?

31:56.880 --> 31:57.680
I'm sorry.

31:58.400 --> 32:00.400
It's not my fault
that I have good hearing.

32:01.799 --> 32:02.799
I can explain.

32:08.556 --> 32:09.120
Forget it.

32:09.559 --> 32:10.880
You wouldn't care anyway.

32:18.279 --> 32:19.239
Says who.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.999
If it weren't for
what you said yesterday,

32:23.360 --> 32:24.680
I might've made a mistake.

32:26.120 --> 32:27.200
What mistake?

32:27.920 --> 32:29.204
I might abuse my authority

32:29.920 --> 32:32.519
and force a core team member
to leave the project.

32:35.799 --> 32:36.680
You wouldn't.

32:39.319 --> 32:40.120
I would.

32:41.559 --> 32:43.799
If you two still had feelings
for each other,

32:44.999 --> 32:46.120
I definitely would.

32:52.160 --> 32:53.279
So tell me,

32:54.039 --> 32:55.559
the great Dr. Qu,

32:55.737 --> 32:57.715
how long are you planning
to stay this time?

32:58.440 --> 33:00.600
Given the unstable factor around you,

33:00.960 --> 33:01.799
I've decided

33:02.982 --> 33:04.026
I'm not leaving.

33:04.999 --> 33:05.799
You're not leaving?

33:06.400 --> 33:07.640
I've applied for a transfer

33:07.920 --> 33:09.279
to Jiangcheng People's Hospital.

33:10.079 --> 33:10.759
Why?

33:13.799 --> 33:14.799
Because your husband

33:15.440 --> 33:16.680
is highly skilled.

33:17.600 --> 33:19.319
And this place really needs

33:19.319 --> 33:21.559
a young and promising doctor like me

33:21.680 --> 33:23.360
with great skills.

33:27.160 --> 33:28.960
Alright, get up.

33:29.759 --> 33:30.880
After breakfast,

33:31.026 --> 33:32.920
come with me to the hospital
to report in, okay?

33:33.239 --> 33:33.600
Okay.

33:58.799 --> 34:00.120
You should reflect on yourself.

34:00.600 --> 34:02.920
Don't do this kind
of profiteering again.

34:03.319 --> 34:03.759
Understood?

34:03.759 --> 34:04.200
Fei Ting.

34:04.719 --> 34:05.160
Fei Ting.

34:06.200 --> 34:06.719
Lin Mei.

34:08.119 --> 34:08.920
What's going on?

34:09.920 --> 34:10.559
Officer.

34:11.199 --> 34:11.999
You're his wife?

34:12.400 --> 34:12.840
Yes.

34:13.320 --> 34:14.479
What did he do?

34:14.782 --> 34:16.982
He illegally sets up a street stall
selling roasted sweet potatoes.

34:17.030 --> 34:18.650
He was even
playing cat and mouse with us.

34:18.848 --> 34:20.337
You actually think you can outrun us?

34:22.800 --> 34:23.999
No, it can't be, Officer.

34:24.079 --> 34:25.800
You must be mistaken.

34:26.070 --> 34:26.804
My husband works

34:26.848 --> 34:29.310
in the Publicity Department
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory.

34:29.320 --> 34:31.039
How could he be selling sweet potatoes?

34:31.079 --> 34:32.360
You've got the wrong person.

34:32.880 --> 34:34.639
Fei Ting, were you set up again?

34:37.840 --> 34:38.360
Hurry.

34:39.039 --> 34:40.840
Explain to the officer.

34:40.840 --> 34:43.240
Tell him what happened.
Were you framed? Speak!

34:43.479 --> 34:44.079
I...

34:45.440 --> 34:46.199
was fired.

34:49.720 --> 34:51.320
When were you fired?

34:51.479 --> 34:53.320
Why didn't you tell me?

34:53.440 --> 34:54.119
What happened?

34:54.119 --> 34:55.199
Why were you fired?

34:55.199 --> 34:56.720
Enough. Don't hit him.

34:56.720 --> 34:58.320
Stop hitting him.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.320
You can talk this out.

35:02.400 --> 35:03.159
Officer,

35:04.079 --> 35:05.960
I'll discipline him properly.

35:06.720 --> 35:08.320
I'll let this go this time.

35:09.440 --> 35:10.599
Afterward,

35:10.880 --> 35:12.760
you have to listen to your wife.

35:13.119 --> 35:14.999
Don't engage in profiteering again.

35:15.400 --> 35:16.039
Got it?

35:17.639 --> 35:18.240
Yes.

35:18.240 --> 35:19.280
Alright, go.

35:19.280 --> 35:19.720
I'm busy.

35:19.720 --> 35:20.320
Let's go.

35:20.519 --> 35:22.720
Officer,

35:22.920 --> 35:23.720
my cart...

35:24.320 --> 35:24.760
What?

35:25.639 --> 35:26.720
You want to stay here?

35:26.720 --> 35:28.079
Go.

35:28.199 --> 35:29.199
Sorry for the trouble.

35:29.880 --> 35:30.840
What's going on?

35:30.980 --> 35:35.180
(Hongxing Supply and
Marketing Cooperative)

35:53.715 --> 35:56.337
Are you going to escort me
all the way to the counter?

35:57.760 --> 35:58.850
Do I need you to walk me in?

36:02.079 --> 36:03.920
Don't you want to explain?

36:05.880 --> 36:06.679
I...

36:07.320 --> 36:08.639
There's nothing to explain.

36:08.639 --> 36:09.999
You already know everything.

36:12.639 --> 36:13.440
Come here.

36:17.240 --> 36:18.599
I really don't get it.

36:18.804 --> 36:20.960
Is the chair in the Publicity Office
burning your bum?

36:20.990 --> 36:23.337
Why can everyone else
sit there just fine, but you can't?

36:23.679 --> 36:25.440
It had come to that point.

36:25.440 --> 36:27.280
If I didn't leave,
Mr. Li would've had to.

36:28.519 --> 36:30.800
You think that makes you noble?

36:31.226 --> 36:32.560
If he hadn't kept egging you on,

36:32.582 --> 36:34.004
would you have lost your job?

36:35.039 --> 36:37.400
It's not entirely his fault.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.119
I really wasn't cut out

36:39.800 --> 36:40.559
for Publicity work.

36:42.519 --> 36:43.159
Fei Ting,

36:43.880 --> 36:45.920
why can't you understand me at all?

36:46.026 --> 36:48.060
I'm not asking you
to achieve anything extraordinary.

36:48.110 --> 36:50.204
But can't you at least try to do better
for my sake?

36:59.648 --> 37:01.382
You shut down like this every time.

37:01.920 --> 37:03.280
There's no point in talking to you.

37:04.400 --> 37:05.720
I'm giving you two choices.

37:06.920 --> 37:07.720
Either

37:09.093 --> 37:10.240
you go find Chief Wang

37:11.720 --> 37:13.280
and get your job back.

37:14.199 --> 37:14.760
Or...

37:18.039 --> 37:19.360
we part ways here.

37:31.960 --> 37:32.720
Ms. Xu,

37:32.960 --> 37:33.960
Fei Ting

37:33.960 --> 37:36.240
was fired
from the Publicity Department.

37:36.559 --> 37:36.920
Yes.

37:36.920 --> 37:38.960
A couple of days ago,
Chief Wang reported

37:39.119 --> 37:41.440
they're short-staffed.

37:41.920 --> 37:42.720
Considering

37:42.720 --> 37:45.519
the factory is about to compete
for the Advanced Production Unit,

37:45.639 --> 37:46.720
they're under pressure.

37:47.079 --> 37:49.039
They hope to recruit someone.

37:50.240 --> 37:53.240
She didn't mention that to me.

37:53.559 --> 37:55.479
Because you've been busy lately.

37:57.280 --> 37:59.159
What does Chief Wang suggest?

37:59.639 --> 38:01.960
She wants to recruit
a university graduate.

38:03.079 --> 38:03.760
I see.

38:04.760 --> 38:07.240
Ms. Xu, Wang Defa from our factory

38:07.240 --> 38:09.559
is studying at Jiangcheng University.

38:10.679 --> 38:11.960
Chief Wang

38:11.960 --> 38:14.280
wants to have him intern first.

38:22.519 --> 38:23.519
Feng Lin,

38:24.720 --> 38:26.400
is that Chief Wang's idea,

38:27.240 --> 38:28.599
or yours?

38:30.639 --> 38:33.159
If she wants Wang Defa,

38:33.159 --> 38:34.360
she can tell me herself.

38:34.880 --> 38:36.519
You don't have to be the messenger.

38:38.720 --> 38:40.519
University spot for Wang Defa,

38:41.240 --> 38:43.159
and now the Publicity Department
for him, too.

38:44.079 --> 38:44.880
What?

38:45.479 --> 38:47.440
Are you pulling strings for him?

38:47.679 --> 38:48.280
No.

38:48.440 --> 38:50.840
All the good things here
go to him alone?

38:51.360 --> 38:52.440
It's not that, Ms. Xu.

38:52.519 --> 38:55.159
Just focus on your own job.

38:55.960 --> 38:58.360
Stay out of other departments' business.

39:03.079 --> 39:03.679
Yes.

39:04.400 --> 39:05.559
Ms. Liu, hanging laundry?

39:05.559 --> 39:06.479
Yes.

39:18.559 --> 39:20.039
In ancient times, the husband studied

39:20.360 --> 39:21.280
while the wife sewed.

39:22.159 --> 39:23.720
We're the opposite.

39:25.840 --> 39:26.479
Dear,

39:27.280 --> 39:29.039
sewing and studying
both strain the eyes.

39:29.119 --> 39:30.079
Let's take a break.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.240
My eyes are just fine.

39:32.440 --> 39:33.280
I don't need a break.

39:41.840 --> 39:43.079
Hey.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.559
It's broad daylight.

39:46.079 --> 39:46.880
What do you think?

39:56.960 --> 39:57.720
Close the curtains.

39:58.800 --> 39:59.240
Okay.

40:02.119 --> 40:02.679
Fang Muyang.

40:04.280 --> 40:04.720
Ting?

40:06.519 --> 40:07.159
Ting.

40:11.199 --> 40:11.840
Ting.

40:11.840 --> 40:12.720
Take it easy.

40:14.960 --> 40:15.760
I'm telling you,

40:17.280 --> 40:19.519
roasting sweet potatoes takes skills.

40:21.720 --> 40:23.079
How thick you plaster the mud

40:23.479 --> 40:24.479
on the oven

40:24.960 --> 40:26.440
and how strong you keep the fire...

40:26.440 --> 40:27.519
Ting,

40:28.479 --> 40:30.159
your problem isn't the sweet potatoes.

40:30.960 --> 40:32.280
It's how to convince Mei.

40:34.159 --> 40:37.039
Maybe I should go beg Chief Wang.

40:37.039 --> 40:37.840
No need.

40:38.639 --> 40:39.519
No one's going.

40:40.039 --> 40:42.840
Even if they asked me back,
I wouldn't return.

40:44.320 --> 40:45.320
A man

40:46.079 --> 40:47.639
has to know his limit.

40:48.360 --> 40:49.960
I'm just not cut out for that.

40:49.960 --> 40:52.079
I'm meant to wield a ladle
and roast sweet potatoes.

40:52.079 --> 40:53.079
What's wrong with that?

40:53.720 --> 40:54.720
I earn money honestly

40:54.720 --> 40:56.079
with my own hands.

40:56.079 --> 40:57.159
There's no shame in that.

40:57.280 --> 40:59.199
No one said you're shameful.

40:59.999 --> 41:02.960
Lin Mei isn't wrong to be angry.

41:02.960 --> 41:05.760
You hid this serious matter
from her for months.

41:05.760 --> 41:07.360
Who wouldn't be mad?

41:07.840 --> 41:08.960
I regret

41:08.960 --> 41:10.039
helping you.

41:10.479 --> 41:11.679
I wanted to tell her.

41:11.679 --> 41:13.039
And it has ended up like today.

41:13.039 --> 41:13.679
But...

41:13.679 --> 41:14.519
Hey.

41:14.999 --> 41:15.519
Say less.

41:19.240 --> 41:20.960
If you can't change yourself,

41:21.720 --> 41:23.240
then you have to convince her.

41:23.639 --> 41:24.880
Convince her of what?

41:26.360 --> 41:28.159
To accept the real you.

41:28.920 --> 41:30.079
You're not some

41:30.880 --> 41:33.119
polished Publicity officer.

41:33.639 --> 41:35.159
You're Chef Fei,

41:35.159 --> 41:36.519
who can cook a feast

41:37.039 --> 41:38.639
and roast sweet potatoes.

41:41.880 --> 41:42.479
The real me.

41:46.079 --> 41:47.039
The real me...

41:53.679 --> 41:54.519
That's right.

41:55.320 --> 41:56.920
That's who I really am.

42:03.240 --> 42:04.159
Ting,

42:04.960 --> 42:06.079
one more thing.

42:06.679 --> 42:07.999
If she still won't forgive you

42:08.519 --> 42:09.960
after you see her tomorrow,

42:10.271 --> 42:11.320
let me teach you a trick.

42:15.559 --> 42:16.679
Childish.

42:19.670 --> 42:20.493
It works wonders.

42:25.760 --> 42:26.519
I'm leaving.

42:26.760 --> 42:27.550
I'll walk you home.

42:27.559 --> 42:29.280
No need. Don't need to see me off.

42:29.519 --> 42:30.360
No one sees me off.

42:30.360 --> 42:31.479
Let Fang Muyang take you.

42:31.479 --> 42:32.639
You're drunk.

42:33.720 --> 42:34.519
Don't.

42:34.604 --> 42:35.720
- Go to bed early.
- Be careful.

42:35.720 --> 42:36.440
Slow down.

42:41.648 --> 42:42.510
What did you tell him?

42:42.519 --> 42:43.519
You wouldn't let me hear.

42:44.360 --> 42:45.880
I'm not telling you.

42:46.440 --> 42:48.119
I'll save it for when I deal with you.

42:49.880 --> 42:50.679
Shall we continue?

42:52.960 --> 42:54.360
Sure. Let's have a drink.

42:55.559 --> 42:56.440
Let's go.

42:56.519 --> 42:59.159
Hey. Close the curtains.

42:59.159 --> 42:59.960
Not this side.

42:59.960 --> 43:00.960
The other side.

43:10.519 --> 43:11.519
You're lying on my hair.

43:11.800 --> 43:12.760
Move a little.

43:12.893 --> 43:14.093
What are you doing?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
